# The pet assistant never sees the Gemini key. The browser calls a small proxy
# (assistant-proxy/, deployed as its own Vercel project) that adds the key on the
# server. Set the key there, not here:
#
#   cd assistant-proxy && vercel env add GOOGLE_GENERATIVE_AI_API_KEY production
#
# Optional. Overrides the proxy URL baked into src/lib/pet-assistant-agent.ts —
# for example to point at `vercel dev` running locally. Set it to an empty value
# to build the site with the assistant showing its "offline" message.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ASSISTANT_PROXY_URL=http://localhost:3001/api/v1beta
